ies of the catastrophe that changed everything.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/df19ab83b4d8c17ca2da7dcfc5487889.webp?t=1772792652\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/e1db7b237839f024eed0e6387f369068.poster.avif?t=1772792652\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/e1db7b237839f024eed0e6387f369068.webm?t=1772792652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/e1db7b237839f024eed0e6387f369068.mp4?t=1772792652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make weapons, modules and equipment from the resources you gather to upgrade your machines and fortify your base. Build and modify rovers with the help of various modules that you can adapt for different tasks, from mining to fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/f250bbf9633754b19b017029339740dc.webp?t=1772792652\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/916a3351238ca2e0ffa20109dea9a5ff.poster.avif?t=1772792652\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/916a3351238ca2e0ffa20109dea9a5ff.webm?t=1772792652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/916a3351238ca2e0ffa20109dea9a5ff.mp4?t=1772792652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconstruct destroyed bases, build defences and structures to survive in dangerous conditions, engage in intense battles with raiders and bosses using advanced weapons and combat modules, and be ready for the challenges of nature: you\u2019ll have to deal with disasters such as sandstorms and radiation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/9ab9bf9b63c7e75f870b963c08743b2f.webp?t=1772792652\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/839e6e9ec3ddee545ae83553759d4f5a.poster.avif?t=1772792652\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/839e6e9ec3ddee545ae83553759d4f5a.webm?t=1772792652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/839e6e9ec3ddee545ae83553759d4f5a.mp4?t=1772792652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign transport rovers to resource gathering, construction, and defence tasks. Plan actions and appoint roles to machines to focus on strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/f82abc96ae90a7bc16cc0979620bead3.webp?t=1772792652\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/159fb81a39ebf1dd856212c5f35b68e2.poster.avif?t=1772792652